<title>POLAND: Elektrim buys satellite transmitter firm.</title>
<headline>Elektrim buys satellite transmitter firm.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA took a 90-percent stake in satellite data transmitter  Polish Phonesat after the latter's recent share issue, Elektrim said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said Polish Phonesat plans to operate a VSAT satellite data transmission system for telecommunication operators, including cellular telephone operators.</p>
<p>Elektrim also said Polish Phonesat, which now has a share capital of three million zlotys, expects to start operations in next year's first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
